      "end": 6689,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.48153623938560486
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 74,
      "text": "The judgments of both the courts are well reasoned and are affirmed.\n 4 of 5  Criminal Revision No. 1269 of 2008 (5)\n11.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 6690,
      "end": 6811,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Criminal Revision No. 1269 of 2008",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 6769,
          "end": 6803
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 75,
      "text": "Learned counsel for the petitioner has vehemently argued that taking into consideration the peculiar facts and circumstances of the case, more particularly the age of the petitioner, a lenient view may be taken.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 6812,
      "end": 7023,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.16194860637187958
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 76,
      "text": "12. The sample was taken on 30.8.1995 and we are in the year 2019.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 7025,
      "end": 7091,
      "entities": [
        {
